    You agree not to use the service for any unlawful purpose or in any
    way that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair our
    infrastructure. You will not attempt to gain unauthorized access to
    any part of the service or to any other accounts.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Purchase and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    LaunchKit is sold as a one-time purchase, not a subscription. Each
    tier (Standard, Lifetime) defines the support window — the
    boilerplate itself is delivered in full at checkout. Payment is
    processed by Polar, our merchant of record.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because the product is delivered as source code via private GitHub
    repository access, we cannot offer refunds once you have been
    invited to the buyers organization. If you change your mind
    <em>before</em> the invite is sent, email us within 7 days of
    checkout for a full refund. After repo access has been granted,
    all sales are final.
  </p>

